	(text "CELL STACK (4S)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7cd55707-768c-41d2-a8dc-9420b3ba9024")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. CELL_N = gauge VSS (cell 1N tab). GND = system ground, on the far side of RS101.\n2. Kelvin-route SRP/SRN from the RS101 pads; R107/R108/C106 at the IC.\n3. VC taps are separate thin traces from the cell end of each holder contact;\n    VC4 from CELL_P_RAW (before F102) so fuse drop is not read as cell voltage.\n4. TS1-TS4: one wired cell NTC each (J102, J105-J107, one per cell); insulated sensors only (cans 0-12.6 V above VSS, TS 2.1 V max). PTC, PTCEN, PRES, DISP tied to VSS per datasheet.\n5. VCC fed from FET common drain via R106 (TI R13). PACK sense via R113 10k (TI R15).\n6. BAT fed from CELL_P_RAW (cell top, before F102) via D101 + R105 (TI fig. 9-12).\n7. Diamonds are PWR_FLAGs (ERC only, no part): each sits where its rail is sourced through a passive part.\n8. Q103 buffers BTP_INT (its high level has no maximum; PA6 takes 4 V unpowered): GAUGE_BTP is active low.\n9. C109 + D102 (DNP): fit if the DSG turn-on inrush into PACK_P trips SCD. D103 (fitted) clamps Q102 VGS at 15 V in a hard short.\n10. Tape the J102 NTC to BT101: a 21700 can is its cell's negative terminal and TS1 is rated 2.1 V.\n11. SW101 wakes the gauge from SHUTDOWN without USB; J104 feeds PACK_P from a current-limited bench supply.\n12. J103 matches the EV2400 SMBus port: 1 VSS, 2 SCL, 3 SDA, 4 VOUT (not used). Fit cells before plugging in USB.\n13. ESD caps (TI): C110+C111 in series across the FET pair (fig. 9-2 C1/C2), C107+C108 across PACK+/PACK- (sec. 9.2.2.1.5).\n14. Second level (TI fig. 9-11): U102 BQ294700 (4.35 V/cell, CD 0.1u = 1-2 s) or the gauge FUSE pin turns Q104 on;\n    F102's heater then blows its fuse, permanently opening the cell top. F102 is also the pack's only overcurrent fuse (no F101).\n    R127 (DNP) is a bench bypass for a blown F102 only: never fitted on a pack in use.\n15. Never insert or remove a cell with USB or J104 power on: an empty holder slot sees PACK_P minus the other cells\n    (> 4.35 V), U102 trips after 1-2 s and F102 blows. Gauge data flash: COV Delay 1 s, Min Blow Fuse Voltage 10500 mV."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.596 248.412 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89b0cf56-9ded-4344-bef1-affe1323f8fe")
	)
