	(text "Holders BT101-BT104 OR welded pack on J101 - never both.\nJ101 is DNP. Check each cell at TP102-TP105 and the stack at TP108 before waking the gauge\n(Q101/Q102 stay off until FET_EN is set, so nothing loads the cells until then)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 40.64 0)
		(effects
