		(property "Notes" "Wired 10k B3435 NTC (Semitec 103AT-2 class, epoxy bead with insulated leads) taped to the side of BT104, over its sleeve. The can is that cell's negative terminal (about 12.6 V above VSS) and the TS pins are rated 2.1 V: keep the sensor insulated. Gauge internal 18k pull-up; enable TS4 in data flash"
